# (CRUSTERMAN) Lead in at Wait (Undertow's): the Lead (MIDI channel 3) plays nothing of its own; a figure on the white
# keys, and it answers and goes on from it; when the figure's kinship is over (Memory 50 at 60: 22 bars, 88 s), silent
# again
wait 500
turn PRESET 1
wait 500
expect piece 1
expect par101 66
peakreset
wait 90000
expect notes_ch3 0
# four notes, a beat each, then quiet
key w0 down
wait 900
key w0 up
wait 100
key w2 down
wait 900
key w2 up
wait 100
key w4 down
wait 900
key w4 up
wait 100
key w2 down
wait 1800
key w2 up
peakreset
wait 40000
expect notes_ch3 >3
# its time over: nothing more
wait 120000
peakreset
wait 90000
expect notes_ch3 0
